 body+='<p>MED26-006 · 私有 / Private · '+e(v['created_at'])+'</p><div class="banner"><b>观察成立，不认定为数据错误 / Observations confirmed, not classified as data errors.</b><p>独立读取核实 9 个病例在原始 CSV 中的 derm 与 clinic 字段相同；984/1011 个 case_id 为严格空字符串，27 个非空。全部原始字段与已收集 Slurm 输出一致。未发现导致这两项观察的解析错误。</p><p class="en">Nine source rows reference the same file for both roles; 984/1011 case_id fields are exactly empty and 27 are populated. All original cells agree with the collected Slurm export. No parser defect causing these observations was found.</p><p><b>更正 / Correction:</b> 9 条原始 notes 全部记录了 clinic→derm 替代。4 条明确临床图缺失，论文第4页也说明了4例此类替代；另5条注明被替代路径，原因未详述。此前“原因未知”的笼统判断不够完整。<br><span class="en">All nine original notes document clinic→derm replacement. Four explicitly identify missing clinical images, consistent with paper p4. Five name the replaced paths without explaining why. The earlier blanket “cause unknown” statement was incomplete.</span></p></div>'
