 body+='<p>本轮未访问 Bunya 文件系统、未提交新 Slurm 作业、未执行模型。读取本地同哈希 ZIP，并复用 28734478 的已验收 CSV／图片清单。实际 scratch CSV 路径如上；原始 RDM ZIP 保持不变。<br><span class="en">No new remote inspection/job or model execution. This review reads the local byte-identical ZIP and reuses the accepted job28734478 records; the actual prior scratch CSV path is listed above.</span></p>'
 body+='<p>独立方式 A：验证 CSV 不含引号、每物理行恰好19字段后，直接按 UTF-8 行和逗号拆分。方式 B：pandas C 引擎，全部按字符串读取，关闭 NA 推断。两者逐单元格一致，且与原 csv.DictReader 输出全部 19,209 个原始字段一致。按原始行序核对 official split、路径、case_num、case_id、诊断；不按空 case_id 关联，不补默认值、不改变大小写。<br><span class="en">Reader A uses literal lines/commas only after guarding no quotes and exactly19 fields per line. Reader B uses pandas C CSV parsing with string dtype and NA inference disabled. All19,209 cells agree with each other and the original DictReader export. Row-index, split, paths and labels agree; no case_id join, default replacement or case folding is used.</span></p>'
 body+='<nav><a href="verification.json">核查 JSON</a><a href="parser-reconciliation.json">解析对应 / Reconciliation</a><a href="raw/meta.csv">原始 CSV / Original</a><a href="audit_derm7pt_observations.py">核查脚本 / Audit script</a><a href="review_checks.ipynb">复查 notebook / Companion</a></nav>'
