 body+='<h2 id="impact">derm-only 的实际影响 / Impact on derm-only</h2><p><b>已验证 / Verified:</b> 每病例取一次 derm 时，1011记录对应1011个不同路径、文件哈希和解码像素哈希。九例同图引用发生在同一病例的两个角色之间，未造成两条 derm 样本重复，也未发现路径／标签错配。数据完整性通过不代表所有模态和临床标签已获人工确认。<br><span class="en">One derm input per row yields1011distinct paths, byte hashes and pixel hashes. The nine cross-role aliases do not duplicate derm samples or cause an observed path/label mismatch. Integrity acceptance does not certify modality or clinical label correctness.</span></p><p><b>范围是条件计数，不是选样决策 / Conditional counts, not sampling decisions:</b> Derm7pt目标诊断合并与官方test/更大探索队列尚未冻结。下表说明不同既有候选范围是否涉及九例；本轮没有删除或纳入新样本。源域 DermaMNIST 的固定70张测试图是另一数据集，勿混淆。<br><span class="en">Target diagnostic grouping and official-test versus exploratory scope remain unfrozen. The table audits candidate scopes without selecting samples. The70-image source DermaMNIST test set is a different dataset.</span></p>'
