 body+='<h2 id="sources">已知、未知与来源 / Evidence & unresolved questions</h2><p>直接事实：九行同路径和原始替代备注、四例缺图描述、984个原始空字符串；两种独立读取与Slurm解析一致。可能解释：另五条也可能是发布整理时的替代，但理由未知，不能推断原clinic损坏或derm标错。仍未知：case_id语义/稀疏原因、另五条替代动机、患者关联与跨数据集重叠、每例人工模态审阅。<br><span class="en">Facts: source aliases/replacement notes, four explicit missing-clinical cases and984literal blanks; independent parsing agrees. Unproven possibility: the additional five substitutions reflect release curation; no claim that original clinic files were corrupt or derm labels wrong. Unknown: field semantics/sparsity reason, five substitution motives, patient/cross-dataset linkage and manual modality judgements.</span></p><p>查找范围：ZIP README及原始notes；固定提交的作者README、dataset.py、web_images notebook；论文第2与4页；官方网站；当前14个issue/PR条目及与数量相关的#11回复。#11回复是非维护者，不作为作者解释。上述材料未找到case_id正式定义；这不等于作者从未提供。<br><span class="en">Search scope: archive README/notes, pinned author README/loader/web notebook, paper pp2/4, official site,14issue/PR entries and relevant#11 reply. That reply is not from a maintainer. No formal case_id definition found within this scope; not a claim that none was ever supplied.</span></p>'
 body+='<ul>'+''.join('<li>'+e(x['id']+': '+x['description'])+'<br><code>'+e(x['location'])+'</code>'+(' · <a href="'+e(x['url'])+'">公开原始来源 / Public source</a>' if x.get('url') else '')+'</li>' for x in sources)+'</ul><p><a href="sources/official-paper.pdf#page=4">论文离线副本，第4页 / Offline paper p4</a> · <a href="sources-receipt.json">来源记录 / Source receipt</a> · <a href="bundle-manifest.json">完整文件哈希 / File hashes</a></p><p class="note">本轮没有需要你批准的数据修正。九例图像类型和明显输入异常仍待人工填写；不自动把审阅意见用于删图或改样本。/ No data correction needs approval now. Manual image-type/anomaly review remains open; review entries never automatically change inputs.</p>'
 js='''const key='humcd-derm7pt-release-v0-MED26-006-review-v1';const fields=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-case]')];const msg=document.getElementById('storage');function snapshot(){let rows={};for(const f of fields){(rows[f.dataset.case]??={})[f.dataset.field]=f.value}return {schema:1,dataset:'Derm7pt-release_v0',rows}}function apply(x){if(x.schema!==1||x.dataset!=='Derm7pt-release_v0'||!x.rows)throw Error('Wrong review identity');for(const f of fields){let v=x.rows[f.dataset.case]?.[f.dataset.field];if(typeof v==='string'){if(f.tagName==='SELECT'&&![...f.options].some(o=>o.value===v))throw Error('Unknown choice');f.value=v}}}try{let s=localStorage.getItem(key);if(s)apply(JSON.parse(s));msg.textContent='本机保存可用；请导出留存 / Local saving available; export for durable records.'}catch(e){msg.textContent='本地保存不可用；请导出或使用CSV / Local storage unavailable; export or use CSV.'}for(const f of fields)f.addEventListener('change',()=>{try{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(snapshot()))}catch(e){msg.textContent='保存失败；请导出 / Save unavailable; export.'}});document.getElementById('export').onclick=()=>{let u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(snapshot(),null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));let a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='derm7pt-manual-review.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};document.getElementById('import').onchange=async e=>{try{apply(JSON.parse(await e.target.files[0].text()));msg.textContent='已导入；请导出留存 / Imported; export to keep.'}catch(x){msg.textContent='导入未完成，请核对文件 / Import failed; check file.'}};'''
 (B/'index.html').write_text(page('Derm7pt source observations | 原始观察核查',body,js))
 recordbody='<nav><a href="index.html">← 核查审阅 / Review</a><a href="all-records-index.csv">CSV</a></nav><h1>1011 原始记录索引 / Full original-record index</h1><p>原始物理行号包括表头；空字符串显示∅，仅用于显示，没有补值。可用浏览器查找case_num、路径或ID。/ Physical line includes header; ∅ displays a literal empty field, not a replacement value. Use browser Find.</p>'
 recordbody+=tab(['CSV行 / line','case_num','case_id','split','derm','clinic','notes','原始行 / Raw line'],[(f'<span id="row-{r["csv_physical_line"]}">{r["csv_physical_line"]}</span>',e(r['case_num']),e(r['case_id']) or '∅',e(r['official_split']),e(r['derm']),e(r['clinic']),e(r['notes']),'<details><summary>原文 / Raw</summary><pre>'+e(raw[int(r['csv_physical_line'])-1])+'</pre></details>') for r in allrows])
 (B/'records.html').write_text(page('Derm7pt full record index',recordbody))
 cells=[{'cell_type':'markdown','metadata':{},'source':['# Derm7pt observation review\nCompanion for independently checking saved raw rows and counts. No model or remote access. The complete executed audit is in audit_derm7pt_observations.py. Notebook not executed during delivery.']},{'cell_type':'code','metadata':{},'execution_count':None,'outputs':[],'source':["from pathlib import Path\nimport json\np = Path('.')\nraw=(p/'raw/meta.csv').read_text()\nassert '\"' not in raw\nlines=raw.splitlines(); header=lines[0].split(',')\nrows=[dict(zip(header, line.split(','))) for line in lines[1:]]\nassert all(len(line.split(','))==19 for line in lines)\nlen(rows), sum(r['case_id']=='' for r in rows), sum(r['derm']==r['clinic'] for r in rows)"]},{'cell_type':'code','metadata':{},'execution_count':None,'outputs':[],'source':["[(i+2,r['case_num'],r['derm'],r['clinic'],r['notes']) for i,r in enumerate(rows) if r['derm']==r['clinic']]"]}]
 (B/'review_checks.ipynb').write_text(json.dumps(dict(nbformat=4,nbformat_minor=5,metadata={'kernelspec':{'display_name':'Python 3','language':'python','name':'python3'}},cells=cells),indent=2)+'\n')
 manifest={str(p.relative_to(B)):hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest() for p in sorted(B.rglob('*')) if p.is_file() and p.name!='bundle-manifest.json'}
 (B/'bundle-manifest.json').write_text(json.dumps(dict(id='derm7pt-observation-review',dataset_id='derm7pt-release_v0-source-review',entry='index.html',created_at=datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(),files=manifest),indent=2)+'\n')
 print('Built private bundle:',B,'files',len(manifest))
